<div id="urduTextPath">الوداع/ائے شاہِ کربلا تیری خدمت نہ ہو سکی</div>

<p>aye sogwaaro aah-o buka ka muqaam hai<br />
ab ruqsat-e hussain alaihis salaam hai<br />
mehmaa'n tumhaara jaata hai jo tashna kaam hai<br />
sar peeto qaak udaao ke maatam tamaam hai</p>

<p>ab wo sadaa-e haye hussaina na aayegi<br />
ghar me tumhaare fatima zehra na aayegi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye shaah-e karbala teri qidmat na ho saki<br />
aye kushta-e jafaa teri qidmat na ho saki<br />
aye jaane fatima teri qidmat na ho saki<br />
mehmaan-e- nainawa teri qidmat na ho saki</p>

<p>jee bhar ke ro sake na ye gardish naseeb ki<br />
majlis ye aaqri hai hussain-e ghareeb ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>agle baras hussain muharram me aayenge<br />
baaqi rahi hayaat to ye gham manaayenge<br />
aur fatima ke laal par aansu bahaayenge<br />
gar margaye to qabr me ham qaak udaayenge</p>

<p>tayyaar qaafela hai shah-e mashraqain ka<br />
lo karbala ko jaata hai kunba hussain ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>abbas-e baawafa ali akbar na jaaiye<br />
jhule ko qaali chord ke asghar na jaaiye<br />
lekar baraat qaasim-e bepar na jaaiye<br />
veera'n makaan hota hai sarwar na jaaiye</p>

<p>aayi sadaa na ro azaadar aayenge<br />
phir agle saal apne bhare ghar ko laayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bin byaahe noujawaa'n ali akbar bhi aayenge<br />
mashk o alam ke saath baradar bhi aayenge<br />
baano ki godh me ali asghar bhi aayenge<br />
noushaah banke qaasim-e bepar bhi aayenge</p>

<p>zainab ka haath thaame sakina bhi aayegi<br />
ek shab ki byaahi fatima kubra bhi aayegi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zainab ke laal baandhke hathyaar aayenge<br />
sughra mareez aabid-e beemaar aayenge<br />
shabbar ke saath hyder-e karrar aayenge<br />
zehra ko thaame ahmed-e muqtaar aayenge</p>

<p>dil kyu na beqaraar ho bint-e rasool ka<br />
majrooh aaj tak bhi hai pehlu batool ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>be chain fatima hai na aansu bahaao tum<br />
mai jaa raha hu roke na mujh ko rulaao tum<br />
zehmat na ho to meri ziyaarat ko aao tum<br />
turbat pe aake ashko'n ki chaadar chadhaao tum</p>

<p>mehmaa'n jo karbala me mere paas aayenge<br />
un sab ki peshwaai ko abbas aayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lo alvidaa hota hai ruqsat ye tashna kaam<br />
tum rorahe ho maah-e moharram se subh-o shaam<br />
kousar pe apne haath se dunga mai bhar ke jaam<br />
ruqsat hussain hota hai tum par mera salaam</p>

<p>dono jahaa'n me qush raho aur shaad tum raho<br />
amma duaa'e deti hai aabaad tum raho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haa aashiqo hussain ke aah-o bukaa karo<br />
zehra ka saath do madad-e mustafa karo<br />
haqq-e mohabbat-e shah-e bekas adaa karo<br />
ab kooch hai hussain ka mehshar bapaa karo</p>

<p>lo ab vidaa kijiyo aal-e rasool ko<br />
do aaqri hussain ka pursa batool ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye tashna kaam-o bekas-o nakaam alwedaa<br />
aye mubtelaa-e hasrat-o aalaam alwedaa<br />
aye bekafan ali ke gul andaam alwedaa<br />
mazbooh tegh-e shimr bad anjaam alwedaa</p>

<p>muzlumiyat pe aapki jaa'n apni khoyenge<br />
jab tak hai zinda aapke maatam me royenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye shah-e karbalaa-e mo'alla salaam lo<br />
ham bekaso'n ke waali-o moula salaam lo<br />
aqaa salaam lo shah-e waala salaam lo<br />
aye fatima ke chaand hamaara salaam lo</p>

<p>ruqsat ye aaqri hai dilafgaar aaye hai<br />
moula salaam lo ye azaadaar aaye hai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>